<title>MEXICO: Texas to Mexico livestock export weekly - April 29.</title>
<headline>Texas to Mexico livestock export weekly - April 29.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA reported Tuesday updated figures of livestock exports to Mexico from the state of Texas to April 29.</p>
<p>Species		   Wk-To-Date   Yr-Date   Last Year</p>
<p>1) Beef Cattle</p>
<p>a.  Slaughter		283	    39,845     17,925</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Males	   0		 989	  525</p>
<p>c.  Breeding Females	 0	     2,094	  538</p>
<p>Total			  283	    42,928     18,988</p>
<p>2) Hogs</p>
<p>a.  Slaughter		  0		 410     31,450</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Males	   0		 242	   46</p>
<p>c.  Breeding Females	 0	     3,118	  311</p>
<p>3) Dairy Cattle</p>
<p>a.  Breeding Males	  25		  98	   18</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Females     116	    10,156	3,965</p>
<p>Total			  141	    10,254	3,983</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530))</p>
<p>E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com</p>
